<title>USA: Sun senior vice president leaving company.</title>
<headline>Sun senior vice president leaving company.</headline>
<dateline>PHILADELPHIA 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sun Co Inc said Greg Driscoll, a senior vice president, has elected to leave the company to pursue other opportunities.</p>
<p>Driscoll had responsibility for two of Sun's seven business units -- Sunoco Northeast Marketing and Sun Lubricants.</p>
<p>The company said the marketing unit will now report directly to Sun's new president, Jack Drosdick, and the lubricants unit will report to Sun Senior Vice President Deborah Fretz.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
